<title>UK: Dexia Hypo to launch 1.0 bln mark 5-yr Pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>Dexia Hypo to launch 1.0 bln mark 5-yr Pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dexia Hypothekenbank is expected to launch a 1.0 billion mark Pfandbrief on Tuesday, joint lead managers said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Dexia Hypothekenbank is the new name of CLF Hypothekenbank AG as of July 1, 1997.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to have a maturity of July 8, 2002 subject to market conditions and will be priced against the BOBL 122 due February 2002.</p>
<p>Joint lead managers for the transaction are Bayer Hypo, CDC, DG Bank, Dresdner KB, HSBC Trinkaus and LB Hessen-Thurigen.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
